{"data": [{"author_id": "1705880794001281024", "created_at": "2026-10-19T20:41:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112282945323209207"], "id": "2112282945323209207", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 206, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112212148743197163", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Kolkata is jam Packed but on selected locations this time . Possible effect of SM\n\nHad to abandon Tridhara and Deshapriya Park today cause of crazy crowd https://t.co/mf8JAPCtnu", "url": "https://x.com/BengalMafia/status/2112282945323209207"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112249016528539648"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:26:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112249040251637894"], "id": "2112249040251637894", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2501, "like_count": 62, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "Chaltabagan at 11:52PM. No crowd or ad banners.\n\nHome to three iconic Durga Pujas (Lohapatty, Sarbojanin, Simla).\n\nClose to Hatibagan Nabin Pally, Kashi Bose, Nalin Sarkar, College Square, Santosh Mitra, Shyambazar &amp; Sealdah Station.\n\nPUJA VIBES ARE MISSING BECAUSE OF BJP! https://t.co/ZKD7yShUNJ", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2112249040251637894"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112174526960427008"]}, "author_id": "141584822", "created_at": "2026-10-19T13:42:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112177593713902026"], "id": "2112177593713902026", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1223, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Kolkata, West Bengal: Kolkata\u2019s Santosh Mitra Square Durga Puja pandal is witnessing heavy footfall, prompting authorities to deploy an AI-powered crowd management system following the Chorbagan incident. Senior police officers, personnel and volunteers are monitoring crowds and https://t.co/kRzpCcIbnN", "url": "https://x.com/ians_india/status/2112177593713902026"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112167355782742016"]}, "author_id": "1759219340178833408", "created_at": "2026-10-19T13:05:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112168209965285816"], "id": "2112168209965285816", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 532, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Santosh Mitra Square \n\nReally good crowd management, but the exit was kinda suffocating. https://t.co/wtikayHDYi", "url": "https://x.com/itzme3d_1/status/2112168209965285816"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112097407140016128", "3_2112097407140057088", "3_2112097407182000128", "3_2112097407169437696"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:23:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112097414836531229"], "id": "2112097414836531229", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\udcf0 NISHAAN makes headlines!\n\nThe inauguration of Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja\u2019s 84th edition finds a place across the press. Grateful to the journalists sharing our story of faith, art and heritage. \ud83d\ude4f\n\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #NishaanTheMark https://t.co/R3X70tWnZs", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112097414836531229"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112097205490528256", "3_2112097205490495488", "3_2112097205448495104", "3_2112097205448499200"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:23:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112097213392580776"], "id": "2112097213392580776", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\udcf0 A mark of faith. A story making headlines.\n\nThe inauguration of Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja\u2019s 84th edition and \u201cNISHAAN \u2014 The Mark\u201d finds a place across the press. \ud83d\ude4f\u2728\n\nThank you to the publications\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #NishaanTheMark #DurgaPuja20d https://t.co/bzz28fW05M", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112097213392580776"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112053250153472001"]}, "author_id": "1295790336468381696", "created_at": "2026-10-19T05:28:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112053295539994715"], "id": "2112053295539994715", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 219, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u0936\u093e\u0930\u0926\u0940\u092f \u0928\u0935\u0930\u093e\u0924\u094d\u0930\u093f \u0915\u0947 \u092a\u093e\u0935\u0928 \u0905\u0935\u0938\u0930 \u092a\u0930 \u092e\u093e\u0902 \u0926\u0941\u0930\u094d\u0917\u093e \u0915\u0947 \u0926\u0930\u094d\u0936\u0928 \u0914\u0930 \u092a\u0942\u091c\u093e-\u0905\u0930\u094d\u091a\u0928\u093e \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0936\u094d\u0930\u0926\u094d\u0927\u093e\u0932\u0941\u0913\u0902 \u0915\u0940 \u092d\u0940\u0921\u093c \u0909\u092e\u0921\u093c \u0930\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u092d\u0915\u094d\u0924 \u092e\u093e\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u091a\u0930\u0923\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0936\u0940\u0936 \u091d\u0941\u0915\u093e\u0915\u0930 \u0938\u0941\u0916, \u0936\u093e\u0902\u0924\u093f \u0914\u0930 \u0938\u092e\u0943\u0926\u094d\u0927\u093f \u0915\u093e \u0906\u0936\u0940\u0930\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0926 \u092e\u093e\u0902\u0917 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0926\u0947\u0916\u093f\u090f, \u0915\u0947\u0928\u094d\u0926\u0941\u0906 \u0936\u093e\u0902\u0924\u093f \u0938\u0902\u0918 \u0926\u0941\u0930\u094d\u0917\u093e \u092a\u0942\u091c\u093e \u0915\u0940 \u0916\u0942\u092c\u0938\u0942\u0930\u0924 \u091d\u0932\u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e\u0902\u0964\n\n#SharadiyaNavratri #Navratri2026 https://t.co/EnRZwhjJPj", "url": "https://x.com/GoodNewsToday/status/2112053295539994715"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-19T03:40:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112026073600807155"], "id": "2112026073600807155", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1891953707249696768", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112025929514107004", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@TatTea007 @Sydusm The claim is largely accurate. No fatal stampedes occurred during Durga Puja in Kolkata prior to 2026; the 2015 Deshapriya Park incident caused injuries but no deaths. On 17 October 2026, a stampede at the Chorbagan Sarbojanin pandal killed 19 amid rain and crowd issues. This was", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2112026073600807155"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-19T03:03:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112016643983372721"], "id": "2112016643983372721", "in_reply_to_user_id": "992339246697529344", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112016524932530575", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@loudspeaker_off @ANI Correct. The 2015 Deshapriya Park incident involved a major crowd surge for the tallest idol, resulting in 11 injuries and no deaths. Police closed public access afterward. Contemporary reports and later accounts confirm it was non-fatal, with the 2026 Chorbagan stampede marked", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2112016643983372721"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-19T01:42:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111996288522653978"], "id": "2111996288522653978", "in_reply_to_user_id": "875891444", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111996158814073151", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ArshadAPervez @ANI No. Available reports confirm the October 2026 Chorbagan Sarbojanin incident was the first fatal stampede at a Durga Puja pandal in Kolkata. The closest prior case was the 2015 Deshapriya Park crowd surge around the tall idol, which caused injuries and chaos but no deaths.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2111996288522653978"}, {"author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-18T22:31:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111948413189357713"], "id": "2111948413189357713", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 5715, "like_count": 188, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 28}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111947703219560730", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I went to New Alipore &amp; Behala tonight.\n\nFor the first time in my life, I didn't see lighting in Behala and crowd in New Alipore.\n\nOther than Tridhara, Santosh Mitra Square &amp; Chorebagan, no Durga Puja has been able to leave their mark.\n\nBJP have well &amp; truly ruined Durga Puja. https://t.co/L3DsUjh4uq", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2111948413189357713"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111889006954991617", "3_2111889027305783296", "3_2111889047274823680", "3_2111889065457135616"]}, "author_id": "1023150691030728704", "created_at": "2026-10-18T18:36:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111889089515684030"], "id": "2111889089515684030", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 409, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#90 Visited Singhi Park. Great as always. Great pandal and their traditional pratima style. They maintain their tradition and royalty. https://t.co/JymWVsazRR", "url": "https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111889089515684030"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111887009405075456", "3_2111887024684933120", "3_2111887044637270016", "3_2111887070134505472"]}, "author_id": "1023150691030728704", "created_at": "2026-10-18T18:28:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111887088958513154"], "id": "2111887088958513154", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 619, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "#88 Visited Ekdalia. Beautiful pandal and pratima as always. Look at the posture of pratima. That is what sets it apart from the rest. Face, eyes aren't the only things. Look at how mother and rest are sitting. Absolutely stunning. Greatest of South Kolkata for a reason. https://t.co/cfJE7N9sHP", "url": "https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111887088958513154"}, {"author_id": "335221924", "created_at": "2026-10-18T17:45:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111876373098926304"], "id": "2111876373098926304", "in_reply_to_user_id": "335221924", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111503170132435037", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@satyanewshi After Deshapriya park incident in 2015 didi build a strong disaster management team and posted some efficient police officers. New govt transferred those officers in remotes. Today CM brought back those efficient officers and entrusted them with crowd management duty.", "url": "https://x.com/parthagee/status/2111876373098926304"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-18T15:44:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111845926893437323"], "id": "2111845926893437323", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3066839160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111845806802341977", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@BlessPvtLtd No, there has not been a deadly stampede at a Durga Puja pandal in Kolkata before 2026. \n\nThe closest prior incident was at Deshapriya Park in 2015, where a massive crowd to view an 88-foot idol caused a near-stampede that injured about 11 people but resulted in no deaths.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2111845926893437323"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-18T15:35:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111843534890222042"], "id": "2111843534890222042", "in_reply_to_user_id": "314305329", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111843340413268186", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@amreadingsay @IndianExpress The most recent stampede in West Bengal is the one at Chorbagan Sarbojanin Durga Puja pandal in Kolkata on 17 October 2026, which killed 19 people.\n\nBefore that, a non-fatal crowd surge at Deshapriya Park during Durga Puja in 2015 injured around 11 people. The last fatal stampede", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2111843534890222042"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2111838668310880256", "3_2111838916492070912", "3_2111838929611812865", "3_2111838943465676800"]}, "author_id": "1341576373672898561", "created_at": "2026-10-18T15:16:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111838956790906923"], "id": "2111838956790906923", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 4106, "like_count": 375, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 28}, "text": "#33 Visited the  Hazra Park Durgatsav\u2014 This is @SobhandebChatt1's Puja, theme showcases Bengal's own folk arts https://t.co/3Q6p2GmFRM", "url": "https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2111838956790906923"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111835878041800705", "3_2111835892260425728", "3_2111835909754855424", "3_2111835925282226176"]}, "author_id": "1098908357132464128", "created_at": "2026-10-18T15:04:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111835937223393662"], "id": "2111835937223393662", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 809, "like_count": 47, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Visited Santosh Mitra Square today afternoon.\n\nTheme- Vande Mataram\n\nQuite detailed and impressive https://t.co/wjl3DGdnzC", "url": "https://x.com/lofITechie/status/2111835937223393662"}, {"author_id": "1304835685610737665", "created_at": "2026-10-18T14:56:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111833790557605926"], "id": "2111833790557605926", "in_reply_to_user_id": "174285951", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 447, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111825968365273478", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@mayukhrghosh People love pujo crowd?? Seriously?? I want to know who those people are!!\n2019 was when I went pandal hopping in Kolkata on Shoptomi. I swore not to do that ever again! Escaped a stampede like situation in ekdalia! Joto rajjer chapri, Bihari crowd rastay!", "url": "https://x.com/Tinniz1/status/2111833790557605926"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111806156209590272"]}, "author_id": "1533527648051204096", "created_at": "2026-10-18T13:06:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111806165005037868"], "id": "2111806165005037868", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 5975, "like_count": 133, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 41, "retweet_count": 32}, "text": "TMC Chotichatas saying- \u201cnot one stampede from mismanagement, During 15 yrs of Mamata\u2019s rule\u201d.\u2026delulu\n\nReality: \n\u2022 2015 Deshapriya Park \u201cbiggest Durga\u201d \u2014 stampede, 11 injured on day one\u2028\u2022 2017 Gangasagar \u2014 6 dead in jetty crush. TMC called it \u201cheart attack,\u201d not stampede\u2028\u2022 https://t.co/iOfhSwxF4l", "url": "https://x.com/rohannagg/status/2111806165005037868"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111787391665262592"]}, "author_id": "40635936", "created_at": "2026-10-18T12:15:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111793201279639611"], "id": "2111793201279639611", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 120, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111536940868829656", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Just because it has happened at one pandal, doesn't mean that the others are completely fine and risk-free.\n\nFor folks who have visited the Deshapriya Park Puja Pandal will agree that the entry point to the main pandal is perhaps narrower than even this. [1] https://t.co/IoZpwnLo5y https://t.co/p1sxMQ41rH", "url": "https://x.com/sayan_dey/status/2111793201279639611"}, {"author_id": "4406245579", "created_at": "2026-10-18T11:33:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111782740685426906"], "id": "2111782740685426906", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3007649773", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111662516615184475", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@biharigurl Glad you mentioned Deshapriya Park\nOne of the examples of good administration, took the decision to close it before someone died.\nChorebagan should have been closed after Friday night video went viral. But BJP had to do PR on the crowd numbers.", "url": "https://x.com/the_echel0n_/status/2111782740685426906"}, {"author_id": "2296611235", "created_at": "2026-10-18T11:17:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111778704221462626"], "id": "2111778704221462626", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "X2817/26\n\n\ud83d\udea8 A tragic first in Kolkata\u2019s Durga Puja history\u2014and a warning we cannot afford to ignore.\n\nBefore the October 2026 Chorbagan tragedy, Kolkata had witnessed dangerous crowd surges at Durga Puja pandals, but no previously reported fatal stampede during the celebrations.", "url": "https://x.com/SLuharuwalla/status/2111778704221462626"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-18T11:01:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111774685931147372"], "id": "2111774685931147372", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1700799305760849920", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111774550904238311", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@gypsywind13 A stampede at Chorbagan pandal on 17 Oct 2026 (Maha Saptami) killed 19 people amid rain and crowd surge. Reports from Indian Express and Times of India confirm no prior fatal stampede at any Kolkata Durga Puja pandal. The 2015 Deshapriya Park crowd crush injured about 11 with", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2111774685931147372"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-18T09:26:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111750676548034906"], "id": "2111750676548034906", "in_reply_to_user_id": "70222254", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111750543513395306", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Kamalasif @SuvenduWB @BJP4Bengal @MamataOfficial @AdhirRChowdhury @MahuaMoitra No, there were no fatal stampedes at any Durga Puja pandal in Kolkata before October 2026. The closest major incident was a 2015 crowd surge at Deshapriya Park involving the tallest Durga idol; it caused injuries and chaos but no deaths.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2111750676548034906"}], "includes": {"media": [{"height": 2304, "media_key": "3_2112249016528539648", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVA3ShNaEAASL9F.jpg", "width": 4096}, {"height": 1080, "media_key": "13_2112174526960427008", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112174526960427008/img/ChF-BS90N1W7PRTE.jpg", "type": "video", "width": 1920}, {"height": 720, "media_key": "13_2112167355782742016", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_v